DTSTART:20261223T063000
DTEND:20261223T073000
SUMMARY:[RW] Tempo ride (3 x 8 min) (60 min)
DESCRIPTION:12 min warm-up\; 3 x (8 min tempo + 4 min easy)\; 8 min cool-d
 own. Tempo is comfortably hard (RPE 6\, about 76-90 % of FTP). Even power
 \, seated.\n\nWeek 5 (BUILD). Not medical advice\; pain that changes how 
 you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-12-24-swim2-swim-main-set-3-x-3-@rampwise
DTSTAMP:20261117T003912Z
DTSTART:20261224T063000
DTEND:20261224T070000
SUMMARY:[RW] Swim: main set (3 x 3 min) (30 min)
DESCRIPTION:8 min easy swim + kick\; 6 min drills\; 3 x (3 min tempo + 0.5
  min recovery)\; 5 min cool-down. Steady-hard repeats (RPE 6)\, even pace
  from the first to the last. Swim time and effort\, not distance: pools a
 nd paces differ. If you know your 100 m time\, convert the minutes to met
 res. Rest 15-30 s between repeats.\n\nWeek 5 (BUILD). Not medical advice\
 ; pain that changes how you move means stop.\nrampwise-plan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
